# Agatha's Soul Cauldron: the abilities it lends last only while it is on the battlefield (CR 611.3a). Turn 3: Looting
# discards Blazing Rootwalla, the Cauldron exiles it and Ornithopter gets a counter and "{R}: +2/+0" (paid with Mox
# Sapphire, so Ornithopter attacks as a 3/3 in the positive control). Abrade then destroys the Cauldron. Turn 5: the
# Ornithopter is still a creature with the counter, but its pump is gone - refused, though the Rootwalla card is still
# in exile.

